#. type: Title-text
#: ../scene.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mover 1"
msgstr "Trasporto 1"

#. type: Resume-text
#: ../scene.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve a titanium cube."
msgstr "Recupera un cubo di titanio."

#. type: ScriptName-text
#: ../scene.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mover"
msgstr "Mover"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exercise"
msgstr "Esercizio"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Move the <a object|titan>titanium cube</a> on the finishing pad. You do not "
"know the position of the titanium, but we can tell you the position of the "
"finishing pad x=10 and y=-60."
msgstr ""
"Porta il <a object|titan>cubo di titanio</a> sulla piattaforma di arrivo. "
"Non ne conosci la posizione iniziale, ma la piattaforma è a x=10, y=-60."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "The instruction <code>goto</code>"
msgstr "L’istruzione <code>goto</code>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In order to solve this problem easily, we will use a new way to move the bot"
" with the instruction <code><a cbot|goto>goto</a></code>. With this "
"instruction you can very easily reach every position, if you know the exact "
"location in the form of its x and y coordinates. The bot will turn towards "
"the goal, move forward, and even turn around any obstacle."
msgstr ""
"Per semplificare usa <code><a cbot|goto>goto</a></code>: conoscendo x e y "
"della destinazione, il robot si gira, avanza e aggira persino gli ostacoli."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "If we summarize, the following are the different ways to move a bot:"
msgstr "Riepilogo dei modi per spostare un robot:"

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "<code>motor(left, right)</code>"
msgstr "<code>motor(left, right)</code>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Allows a direct, precise control of the two motors, and allows you to stay "
"in control of the motors at every fraction of a second."
msgstr ""
"Controllo diretto e preciso dei due motori, modificabile a ogni frazione di "
"secondo."

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "<code>move(distance)</code> and <code>turn(angle)</code>"
msgstr "<code>move(distance)</code> and <code>turn(angle)</code>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use these instructions in order to move forward of a certain distance, or to"
" perform a rotation of a certain angle. All parameters are relative to the "
"current position of the bot."
msgstr ""
"Spostamento di una distanza o rotazione di un angolo, relativi alla "
"posizione attuale."

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "<code>goto(position)</code>"
msgstr "<code>goto(position)</code>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Allows you to reach easily a given absolute position."
msgstr "Raggiunge facilmente una posizione assoluta."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "The program"
msgstr "Il programma"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the instruction <c/><a cbot|radar>radar</a>(Titanium);<n/> in order to "
"find the titanium cube. Then test if a titanium cube has actually been "
"found. In this exercise, this line is not very useful, because we know that "
"there is a titanium cube somewhere. However, it is better to take the habit "
"of testing whatever your radar returns:"
msgstr ""
"Trova il cubo con <c/><a cbot|radar>radar</a>(Titanium);<n/>, poi verifica "
"il risultato. Qui sappiamo che esiste, ma è bene abituarsi a controllare "
"sempre il radar:"

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"object  item;\n"
"item = radar(Titanium);\n"
"if ( item == null )  return;\n"
"goto(item.position);"
msgstr ""
"object  item;\n"
"item = radar(Titanium);\n"
"if ( item == null )  return;\n"
"goto(item.position);"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The variable <code>item</code> is of type <code><a "
"cbot|object>object</a></code>. In order to know the exact location of the "
"object described by the variable, just write <code>item.position</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code>item</code> è di tipo <code><a cbot|object>object</a></code>. La "
"posizione esatta dell’oggetto è <code>item.position</code>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In order to take the titanium cube, use the instruction <code><a "
"cbot|grab>grab</a>()</code> without any parameter."
msgstr ""
"Prendi il cubo con <code><a cbot|grab>grab</a>()</code> senza parametri."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In order to drop the titanium, use the instruction <code><a "
"cbot|drop>drop</a>()</code> without any parameter."
msgstr "Posalo con <code><a cbot|drop>drop</a>()</code> senza parametri."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We know the coordinates of the finishing pad: x=10 et y=-60. You must declare a <a cbot|var>variable</a> of the type <a cbot|point>point</a>, then fill it with the right coordinates. Then you can give this variable as a parameter to the instruction <code><a cbot|goto>goto</a></code>.\n"
"Remark: You do not have to take care of the <code>z</code> coordinate in the case of a bot that can not fly."
msgstr ""
"La piattaforma è a x=10, y=-60. Dichiara una <a cbot|var>variabile</a> <a cbot|point>point</a>, assegnale le coordinate e passala a <code><a cbot|goto>goto</a></code>.\n"
"Nota: per un robot non volante puoi ignorare <code>z</code>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "It is now up to you to finish the program..."
msgstr "Ora completa il programma..."

#. type: \t; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "See also"
msgstr "Vedi anche"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<a cbot>Programming</a>, <a cbot|type>types</a> and <a "
"cbot|category>categories</a>."
msgstr ""
"<a cbot>Programmazione</a>, <a cbot|type>tipi</a> e <a "
"cbot|category>categorie</a>."
